  "description": "Part of the Axiom family. Queries over LDB tables: typed column descriptors, a fluent state machine from conditions to ordering, paging and results, joins, groups, and LINQ conditions analysed (never compiled), Native AOT safe.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
  "id": "Axiom.LDB.Query",
