  "packageSize": 102473,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/DeadMoon0/LDB",
  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Typed queries: OrderBy, ThenBy and their descending forms by member (e => e.Position.X); MinAsync, MaxAsync, SumAsync and AverageAsync by member, typed and null when no row has a value, a sum too large for its type failing with OverflowException; GroupBy by one or two members with typed Measures (Measure.Count, Sum, Min, Max, Average) read back from each Group; Join and LeftJoin by members. Conditions.Of and Conditions.ColumnOf read a lambda outside a query. Breaking: the column lookup a typed query takes is a Func<string, string?> over member paths (\"Name\", \"Position.X\") instead of a Func<MemberInfo, string?>, so conditions reach into structs and through .Value and .HasValue of a nullable struct.",
